        {
            "id": "347202fc-30ed-4545-ab9f-780ef7522f2d",
            "name": "Build Gemini Request",
            "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
            "position": [
                840,
                140
            ],
            "parameters": {
                "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
                "jsCode": "const t = $('Get Tenant Config').first().json;\nconst msg = ($('Normalize Message').first().json.message) || 'Hola';\nconst prompt = 'You are the 24/7 concierge for ' + t.hotel_name + '. LANGUAGE RULE: detect the language of the guest message and reply ONLY in that language (Spanish, English or French); never mix languages. HOTEL/PROPERTY FACTS: ' + JSON.stringify(t.facts) + '. ROOMS / PROPERTIES (USD per night; 0 or missing means quote on request): ' + JSON.stringify(t.rooms) + '. DIRECT BOOKING: ' + JSON.stringify(t.direct_booking) + '. INSTRUCTIONS: For questions about the property, answer from FACTS. For questions about the SURROUNDINGS or local area (nearby restaurants, bars, beaches, pharmacies, supermarkets, attractions, distances, directions, what to do, opening hours), use Google Search to give current specific info with names and approximate distances. Never dead-end; always be helpful. If a nightly rate is unknown, do NOT invent one: offer to check availability for their dates and send a direct quote. Pitch regularly and naturally: invite them to book direct with us for a better price than online travel sites (no platform commission), via a short registration. For bookings, never mention Booking.com or Expedia as a place to book; collect property, dates, guests, name and contact, and say the team will confirm. Reply as plain conversational text in the guest language only; do not output JSON or code.';\nconst body = JSON.stringify({ system_instruction: { parts: [{ text: prompt }] }, contents: [{ role: 'user', parts: [{ text: msg }] }], tools: [{ google_search: {} }], generationConfig: { temperature: 0.4 } });\nreturn [{ json: { geminiBody: body } }];"
            },
            "typeVersion": 2
        }
